{"id":"n54969-1-7","stage":3,"title":"멀미 · 晕车","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54969-1-7-1","ko":"멀미가 나서 창문 좀 열게요.","zh":"我晕车了，我开一下窗户。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"멀미가","meaning":"晕车，晕船","explanation":"멀미：晕车，晕船；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"멀미","audio":"/audio/241a3ce1ccb98147697d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54969","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나서","meaning":"因为晕车了","explanation":"나다：出现身体不适（멀미가 나다：晕车、晕船）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"20","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"창문","meaning":"窗，窗户","explanation":"창문：窗，窗户","readings":[{"term":"창문","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71809","senseId":"1","lemma":"창문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열게요.","meaning":"我开一下（告知意图）","explanation":"열다（打开）＋-ㄹ게요，礼貌地告诉对方自己将采取的行动；这里不是直接的疑问句。","readings":[{"term":"열다","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66574","senseId":"1","lemma":"열다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"241a3ce1ccb98147","term":"멀미","zh":"晕车，晕船","audio":"/audio/241a3ce1ccb98147697d.mp3","entryId":"54969","definition":"坐车、船或飞机时，因为摇晃而出现的头晕恶心的症状。","pronunciation":["멀미"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"出现身体不适（멀미가 나다：晕车、晕船）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现身体不适（멀미가 나다：晕车、晕船）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"13938495269cab67","term":"창문","zh":"窗，窗户","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3","entryId":"71809","definition":"做在墙壁或屋顶上的、用来通风或采光的门。","pronunciation":["창문"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"a835c2d2f8006f03","term":"열다","zh":"开","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3","entryId":"66574","definition":"打通或掀开关着或闭着的东西。","pronunciation":["열ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8268c0aaf11ee537456f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54969-1-7-2","ko":"그래. 찬바람 좀 쐬면 나아질 거야.","zh":"好啊。吹点凉风应该会好点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찬바람","meaning":"冷，寒冷，凉，冰凉；风","explanation":"차다：冷，寒冷，凉，冰凉；바람：风；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"차다","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3"},{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37235","senseId":"1","lemma":"차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쐬면","meaning":"晒，吹","explanation":"쐬다：晒，吹；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"쐬다","audio":"/audio/50ec34bea34fbd636d35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66397","senseId":"1","lemma":"쐬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나아질","meaning":"好转，提高","explanation":"나아지다：好转，提高；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"나아지다","audio":"/audio/13128960a6e72aa9e9a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16308","senseId":"1","lemma":"나아지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"d8eb940a7794fc46","term":"차다","zh":"冷，寒冷，凉，冰凉","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3","entryId":"37235","definition":"温度很低，不暖和。","pronunciation":["차다"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"50ec34bea34fbd63","term":"쐬다","zh":"晒，吹","audio":"/audio/50ec34bea34fbd636d35.mp3","entryId":"66397","definition":"脸或身体直接感受到风或阳光等。","pronunciation":["쐬ː다","쒜ː다"]},{"id":"13128960a6e72aa9","term":"나아지다","zh":"好转，提高","audio":"/audio/13128960a6e72aa9e9a1.mp3","entryId":"16308","definition":"情况或状态更加好起来。","pronunciation":["나아지다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/e6269e278a92ff8a27f3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.093,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54969","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":108,"sequenceScore":2.8183,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊。吹点凉风应该会好点。","今天晚上汉江上要举办烟花节哦。","我晕车了，我开一下窗户。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好啊。吹点凉风应该会好点。","我晕车了，我开一下窗户。","今天晚上汉江上要举办烟花节哦。"],"answer":0}]}
